id: desperate-heal
name: Desperate Heal
advancement: true
prerequisite: Overexertion
tpCost: 10
# "You may spend a number of Ki Points equal to your current Capacity, if you do, increase the amount of Life Points the
# target regains by an equal amount. If you possess the Energy Zone Advancement, this effect can only apply to ONE of the
# targets." A box in its window, with which one where there are several.
healCapacity: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Your current Capacity in KP more: one target regains that much on top.
text: >
  Desperate Heal: You can pour even more energy into healing, allowing you to restore immense amounts of vitality to your
  target.
  –Prerequisites: Overexertion
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: When you target a Character with Healing Hands, you may spend a number of Ki Points equal to your current
  Capacity, if you do, increase the amount of Life Points the target regains by an equal amount. If you possess the
  Energy Zone Advancement, this effect can only apply to ONE of the targets.
